Usage: gitnexus detect-changes|detect_changes [options]

Map git diff hunks to indexed symbols and affected execution flows

Options:
  -s, --scope <scope>   What to analyze: unstaged, staged, all, or compare
                        (default: "unstaged")
  -b, --base-ref <ref>  Branch/commit for compare scope (e.g. main)
  -r, --repo <name>     Target repository
  -h, --help            display help for command
